WEBVTT

00:46.089 --> 00:48.342
[suspenseful music playing]

00:53.305 --> 00:54.431
[Jerrod] Kitana...

00:54.515 --> 00:55.724
I have something for you.

00:56.850 --> 00:57.976
It will protect you.

00:59.853 --> 01:01.563
It's beautiful, Father.

01:03.565 --> 01:05.484
This was a gift from Lord Raiden.

01:05.567 --> 01:06.693
The God of Thunder.

01:08.278 --> 01:10.614
If anything were to happen to me,

01:10.697 --> 01:12.533
he's always listening.

01:19.873 --> 01:22.125
[guard] Shao Kahn
is arriving, Your Majesty.

01:22.209 --> 01:24.378
What happens if you lose?

01:25.796 --> 01:27.089
[Jerrod] Don't worry about that.

01:27.172 --> 01:29.049
But what if he's too strong?

01:29.132 --> 01:30.884
Strength is not a closed fist.

01:31.510 --> 01:32.803
Strength is here,

01:33.929 --> 01:34.805
and here.

01:38.267 --> 01:39.685
Be strong, Kitana.

01:40.352 --> 01:41.603
[Jerrod sighs]

01:46.900 --> 01:51.280
[citizens chanting]
Jerrod, our king! Jerrod, our king!

01:51.780 --> 01:53.991
[chanting continues]

02:06.378 --> 02:09.256
[Kitana] Shao Kahn, Emperor of Outworld,

02:09.339 --> 02:12.426
sought to unite the various realms
under one rule.

02:12.968 --> 02:13.927
His.

02:15.637 --> 02:18.807
But the Elder Gods had put
certain precautions in place.

02:21.768 --> 02:25.022
Our fates would not be settled
by the size of our armies.

02:27.274 --> 02:30.903
They would be decided by combat.

02:31.945 --> 02:33.405
The rules were simple.

02:34.197 --> 02:37.492
If one realm could win
ten tournaments in a row,

02:37.576 --> 02:40.203
it would be given
dominion over the other.

02:40.871 --> 02:44.166
Outworld would be allowed
to pillage Edenia's resources.

02:45.667 --> 02:47.336
Enslave our people.

02:51.757 --> 02:55.302
This was the final tournament.
Our last chance.

02:56.219 --> 02:59.181
All of our greatest warriors
had already fallen.

03:00.766 --> 03:02.351
Only one fighter remained.

03:03.185 --> 03:04.353
My father,

03:05.979 --> 03:07.940
King Jerrod of Edenia.

03:09.524 --> 03:12.486
But he faced Outworld's
greatest warrior.

03:14.696 --> 03:16.823
Shao Kahn himself.

03:18.909 --> 03:20.243
[gasps softly]

03:22.496 --> 03:24.706
[footsteps thudding]

03:25.624 --> 03:27.167
[growls]

03:27.250 --> 03:30.253
They will never bow to you.

03:31.421 --> 03:33.048
[Shao Kahn] We shall see.

03:33.131 --> 03:35.217
[gong tolls]

03:37.052 --> 03:38.887
[tense music playing]

03:43.100 --> 03:44.267
[growls]

03:46.228 --> 03:47.604
[weapons clanging]

03:50.524 --> 03:51.942
-[Jerrod straining]
-[grunting]

03:54.027 --> 03:55.946
-[Jerrod yells]
-[thuds]

04:01.910 --> 04:03.495
[growls]

04:03.578 --> 04:04.496
-[thuds]
-[citizens exclaim]

04:14.172 --> 04:15.007
[Jerrod yells]

04:17.092 --> 04:18.844
[gasps]

04:18.927 --> 04:20.429
[groaning]

04:29.646 --> 04:30.605
Never!

04:39.990 --> 04:41.742
[weapon clatters]

04:41.825 --> 04:43.326
[blade slicing]

04:43.410 --> 04:44.703
[young Kitana gasps]

04:47.622 --> 04:50.125
-[grunts loudly]
-[Shao Kahn screams]

04:52.127 --> 04:53.879
-[blade slices]
-[Shao Kahn groans]

05:00.177 --> 05:02.929
[Jerrod strains, screams]

05:03.013 --> 05:04.431
[citizens gasping]

05:06.475 --> 05:07.893
[screams]

05:11.313 --> 05:13.398
[ominous music playing]

05:19.404 --> 05:20.906
[Jerrod grunting]

05:23.200 --> 05:25.077
[screaming]

05:26.369 --> 05:27.913
[gasps] Kitana, close your eyes.

05:28.789 --> 05:30.624
Close your eyes right now.

05:30.707 --> 05:32.042
[pained groans]

05:34.127 --> 05:35.962
[breathing heavily]

05:39.883 --> 05:41.384
[yells in pain]

05:44.346 --> 05:47.224
-[screams]
-No!

05:47.307 --> 05:49.184
No!

05:49.267 --> 05:51.520
[struggling]

05:51.603 --> 05:54.648
No! [sobbing]

05:55.732 --> 05:57.734
[screaming]

06:00.153 --> 06:02.531
[somber music playing]

06:03.156 --> 06:04.157
[thuds]

06:05.742 --> 06:07.744
[breath trembling]

06:11.414 --> 06:13.250
[crying]

06:17.754 --> 06:19.798
[women crying]

06:23.176 --> 06:24.636
[growls]

06:25.428 --> 06:28.765
[Shao Kahn] Edenia now belongs to me.

06:28.849 --> 06:30.767
[sinister music playing]

06:49.744 --> 06:51.037
[dagger clanks]

06:51.121 --> 06:53.123
-[grunting]
-[blade clanging]

06:54.541 --> 06:55.500
[Sindel growls]

07:04.843 --> 07:05.927
[Sindel grunts]

07:07.053 --> 07:09.973
[Shao Kahn] Kneel. Or you'll die.

07:28.033 --> 07:30.702
[mournful music playing]

08:08.740 --> 08:10.784
[foreboding music playing]

08:17.666 --> 08:20.126
Your father shouldn't have
brought you here.

08:31.888 --> 08:34.557
Kitana, you're my daughter now.

08:42.649 --> 08:44.693
[dramatic choral music playing]

08:48.905 --> 08:49.990
[woman] Kitana!

08:50.073 --> 08:51.908
[thrilling music playing]

08:52.450 --> 08:54.452
[both grunting]

08:56.496 --> 08:57.914
[panting]

08:59.582 --> 09:01.334
[weapons clacking]

09:04.087 --> 09:05.588
[Kitana grunts]

09:23.606 --> 09:25.483
[thrilling music stops]

09:26.776 --> 09:27.610
Yield.

09:44.627 --> 09:45.712
[ribbon snaps]

09:47.547 --> 09:49.257
You cannot be serious.

09:49.966 --> 09:52.302
You're the one who taught me,
everything's a weapon.

09:54.763 --> 09:56.598
[thrilling music resumes]

09:59.267 --> 10:00.393
[woman grunts]

10:00.935 --> 10:02.228
You yield.

10:16.659 --> 10:17.744
What do you have there?

10:18.328 --> 10:19.454
It's nothing.

10:21.206 --> 10:22.123
Jade.

10:24.459 --> 10:26.002
It was 20 years ago today

10:26.086 --> 10:28.088
the Emperor named me as your bodyguard.

10:29.422 --> 10:31.841
I know what Shao Kahn took from you.

10:31.925 --> 10:33.968
And if you had been vicious
or cruel to me,

10:34.052 --> 10:35.345
no one would have blamed you,

10:35.428 --> 10:38.014
but you treated me like family.

10:39.099 --> 10:40.225
Like a sister.

10:42.352 --> 10:43.812
You are my sister.

10:44.813 --> 10:46.523
In every way that matters.

10:49.526 --> 10:53.196
Um, I got you something.
For the tournament.

10:58.159 --> 10:59.828
I was told that a proper princess

10:59.911 --> 11:02.956
is supposed to sit around
on pillows, fanning herself.

11:04.165 --> 11:05.250
Then I thought

11:05.959 --> 11:08.711
you are not exactly the pillow type.

11:08.795 --> 11:10.130
[clanking]

11:13.299 --> 11:14.801
These are amazing.

11:17.929 --> 11:19.931
[suspenseful music playing]

11:27.897 --> 11:29.065
Hello, Mother.

11:30.316 --> 11:33.194
[Shao Kahn] I was beginning
to think you were avoiding me.

11:33.820 --> 11:36.406
I've been busy.
Training for the tournament.

11:38.158 --> 11:40.201
[Shao Kahn] Good.
Because I have petitioned

11:40.285 --> 11:42.287
the Elder Gods
for the tournament to begin.

11:43.079 --> 11:45.623
Let Raiden scrounge
for his little champions.

11:46.166 --> 11:48.334
They will simply be the first to die

11:48.960 --> 11:50.253
and Earthrealm will be mine.

11:51.004 --> 11:52.589
-[gasps]
-[door opens]

11:57.177 --> 11:58.303
[Kitana] Why is he here?

11:58.887 --> 12:00.930
[Shao Kahn] I have a task
for Shang Tsung.

12:02.265 --> 12:04.934
I hope you bring good news, Sorcerer.

12:05.018 --> 12:07.020
My spies have located the relic.

12:08.104 --> 12:10.023
It was last seen in Raiden's temple

12:10.106 --> 12:12.609
where it was stolen
by the mercenary, Kano.

12:13.651 --> 12:15.361
[Shao Kahn]
We seek the Amulet of Shinnok.

12:16.321 --> 12:18.781
[Sindel] It is said the amulet
can heal any wound.

12:18.865 --> 12:21.409
Transform a man into a god.

12:21.493 --> 12:23.036
To charge the amulet would require

12:23.119 --> 12:25.246
an impossible amount of power.

12:25.330 --> 12:27.916
We would need to capture
a star from the heavens.

12:27.999 --> 12:31.044
-A star...
-[dramatic music playing]

12:31.127 --> 12:32.462
...or a god.

12:33.630 --> 12:35.882
[Raiden] Outworld has issued
their challenge

12:35.965 --> 12:37.592
and the Elder Gods have spoken.

12:37.675 --> 12:41.262
When the sand is gone,
the first round will begin.

12:42.263 --> 12:44.140
Mortal Kombat is upon us

12:44.849 --> 12:48.186
and yet we are still short one champion.

12:49.604 --> 12:51.523
[static]

12:59.822 --> 13:03.076
-[tires screeching]
-[suspenseful music playing]

13:07.539 --> 13:08.665
["Rock You Like A Hurricane"
by Scorpions playing]

13:08.748 --> 13:10.458
[singer]
♪ Here I am ♪

13:11.209 --> 13:16.339
♪ Rock you like a hurricane ♪

13:42.448 --> 13:44.200
It's showtime.

13:46.119 --> 13:47.161
[man screams]

13:47.245 --> 13:49.122
["Rock You Like A Hurricane"
continues playing]

13:50.123 --> 13:51.332
♪ Are you ready, baby? ♪

14:01.467 --> 14:02.802
♪ Here I am ♪

14:02.885 --> 14:03.886
[grunts]

14:03.970 --> 14:07.098
♪ Rock you like a hurricane ♪

14:08.516 --> 14:09.642
[steel rod thudding]

14:09.726 --> 14:11.728
♪ Here I am ♪

14:11.811 --> 14:13.438
♪ Rock you like a hurricane ♪

14:13.521 --> 14:14.647
[growls]

14:19.694 --> 14:22.238
[singer vocalizing]

14:24.157 --> 14:26.409
[Johnny] You should have
brought more guys.

14:26.492 --> 14:27.702
♪ The sun comes out ♪

14:27.785 --> 14:31.956
♪ Last night was shaking
And pretty loud ♪

14:32.707 --> 14:33.916
[Johnny grunts]

14:34.000 --> 14:36.044
♪ It scratches my skin ♪

14:36.127 --> 14:39.714
♪ So what is wrong with another sin? ♪

14:46.012 --> 14:47.972
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

14:48.056 --> 14:49.432
♪ Here I am ♪

14:50.475 --> 14:53.061
♪ Rock you like a hurricane ♪

14:53.144 --> 14:55.480
♪ Come on, come on
Come on, come on ♪

14:55.563 --> 14:57.190
[explosion]

14:58.232 --> 14:59.609
[singer]
♪ Rock you like a hurricane ♪

14:59.692 --> 15:01.569
[man 1] Man, Johnny Cage
got old as fuck.

15:01.653 --> 15:04.697
-[snoring]
-[girls shrieking]

15:07.617 --> 15:08.826
[announcer over speakers]
Attention fans,

15:08.910 --> 15:11.579
don't miss your chance to meet
your favorite influencers

15:11.663 --> 15:14.374
and YouTube stars in Autograph Alley.

15:14.457 --> 15:16.042
[woman] All right,
everyone, get in close.

15:16.125 --> 15:17.210
Black Orchid!

15:17.293 --> 15:19.212
[girls cheering]

15:20.213 --> 15:22.006
[upbeat dance music
playing over speakers]

15:27.345 --> 15:28.513
[Johnny] It's showtime.

15:44.529 --> 15:45.530
Johnny Cage.

15:46.364 --> 15:48.324
Hey, guys. I'm off the clock.

15:49.450 --> 15:52.954
Mr. Cage, you have been chosen
for Mortal Kombat.

15:53.037 --> 15:54.956
Mortal Kombat, huh?

15:55.039 --> 15:57.083
What's that? Some kind of fan film?

15:57.166 --> 15:59.001
It's a fighting tournament.

15:59.085 --> 16:01.671
[sighs] Yeah, not really
my thing anymore.

16:03.923 --> 16:05.133
Unless it's a paying gig?

16:05.675 --> 16:08.177
More like a
"fate of the entire human race" gig.

16:08.261 --> 16:10.555
Tell me you're not some crazy fans.

16:11.139 --> 16:12.432
Definitely not fans.

16:12.515 --> 16:13.474
All right. All right.

16:13.558 --> 16:14.809
You don't have to say "definitely."

16:14.892 --> 16:15.893
You have been chosen

16:15.977 --> 16:17.729
as one of the champions of Earthrealm.

16:18.479 --> 16:21.149
The gods have selected you, Mr. Cage.

16:22.024 --> 16:24.527
All right, I think it's time
for you guys to fuck off.

16:24.610 --> 16:26.738
But, hey, love the cosplay. What's that?

16:26.821 --> 16:29.031
Big Trouble in Little China?
Fantastic film.

16:29.115 --> 16:30.408
Listen, I know what it sounds like,

16:30.491 --> 16:31.951
but he's telling the truth.

16:32.034 --> 16:35.204
Very soon the champions
will be summoned to fight

16:35.288 --> 16:36.706
and you will be among them.

16:36.789 --> 16:38.416
The fate of your world

16:38.499 --> 16:40.376
rests on the outcome of this tournament.

16:41.127 --> 16:43.671
Fantastic. I will see you there.

16:43.755 --> 16:45.548
Thanks for coming, drive safe,

16:45.631 --> 16:47.633
and, uh, say hi to Dumbledore for me.

16:47.717 --> 16:49.260
You're gonna have to show him.

16:53.431 --> 16:54.432
[crackling]

17:03.900 --> 17:05.401
Holy shit.

17:06.110 --> 17:07.570
How are you doing that?

17:07.653 --> 17:09.405
[Raiden] Come with us, Mr. Cage,

17:09.489 --> 17:12.116
and discover the man
you were meant to be.

17:18.706 --> 17:20.291
Now, are you coming or what?

17:25.797 --> 17:27.799
[mysterious music playing]

17:45.858 --> 17:47.068
Where the hell am I?

17:48.861 --> 17:50.780
[Sonya] It's okay.
You're still on Earth.

17:50.863 --> 17:52.573
Welcome to Raiden's Sky Temple.

17:52.657 --> 17:54.992
[intriguing music playing]

17:55.076 --> 17:56.828
[all grunting]

17:59.163 --> 18:00.832
[Jax] Watch this. [grunts]

18:02.333 --> 18:05.127
Robot arms. That dude's got robot arms.

18:06.587 --> 18:08.047
[Sonya] We served in the Army together.

18:08.130 --> 18:09.924
That's Jax Briggs. Special Forces.

18:11.467 --> 18:12.635
That's Cole Young.

18:12.718 --> 18:15.012
His suit absorbs attacks
and makes him stronger.

18:15.972 --> 18:17.473
He's a descendant of Scorpion.

18:17.557 --> 18:19.517
One of Earthrealm's greatest warriors.

18:20.601 --> 18:21.644
Oh.

18:21.727 --> 18:22.854
That's Liu Kang.

18:23.688 --> 18:25.314
He's the best fighter we got.

18:33.698 --> 18:36.033
-He shoots fire?
-[Sonya] Mm-hmm.

18:36.117 --> 18:37.201
[scoffs]

18:38.077 --> 18:40.538
I feel like that's cheating, but okay.

18:41.747 --> 18:42.874
It kind of feels like bullshit

18:42.957 --> 18:44.625
that y'all have these crazy powers

18:44.709 --> 18:46.878
and I'm just, you know,
incredibly handsome.

18:48.170 --> 18:49.505
It could take months of training

18:49.589 --> 18:50.715
to unlock your powers.

18:51.424 --> 18:52.675
We don't have that kind of time.

18:52.758 --> 18:54.135
Yeah, well, whose fault is that?

18:54.218 --> 18:55.511
I mean, if you knew this was coming,

18:55.595 --> 18:57.263
why'd you wait
till the last second to find me?

18:57.346 --> 19:00.057
We used to have
another champion. Kung Lao.

19:00.141 --> 19:01.726
Oh, great, so I'm just the fucking sub.

19:01.809 --> 19:03.936
He was murdered. By Shang Tsung.

19:04.020 --> 19:06.188
Wait. Murdered?

19:07.940 --> 19:10.151
Come on. You can't be serious. Right?

19:10.693 --> 19:12.945
I mean, that's, like,
gotta be against the rules.

19:13.446 --> 19:15.406
You can't just go around killing people.

19:16.866 --> 19:19.368
It's called Mortal Kombat for a reason.

19:20.536 --> 19:23.873
Yo, Gandalf, send me back.
I wanna go back.

19:23.956 --> 19:26.250
-Johnny, wait.
-No. No.

19:26.334 --> 19:28.085
You said tournament which implies rules,

19:28.169 --> 19:30.254
and a referee, and I don't know,
maybe a medic.

19:30.338 --> 19:32.381
Not some fucking Squid Game
murder party.

19:32.465 --> 19:34.592
Dude wants to quit, just let him go.

19:34.675 --> 19:35.676
We don't need him.

19:35.760 --> 19:38.888
Look, you wanna step in the octagon

19:38.971 --> 19:40.514
with a bunch of happy assholes

19:40.598 --> 19:43.559
that don't know how to lose,
go right ahead.

19:43.643 --> 19:46.270
But I don't have Transformer arms,

19:46.354 --> 19:48.940
or shoot lightning bolts or fireballs,

19:49.023 --> 19:51.484
or do whatever the fuck it is
Flame Fingers does,

19:51.567 --> 19:54.403
so forgive me if I don't
sign up to get mulched.

19:58.366 --> 20:00.284
You are not wrong, Mr. Cage.

20:08.626 --> 20:10.378
Nine times, we have been challenged.

20:10.461 --> 20:12.254
And nine times, we have lost.

20:12.338 --> 20:14.131
And now, 20 years later,

20:14.215 --> 20:17.176
Shao Kahn seeks to add
Earthrealm to his dominion.

20:18.344 --> 20:21.138
This is a war
for the fate of your world.

20:22.306 --> 20:25.101
[Jax] Look, Cage, I get it. We all do.

20:25.184 --> 20:27.228
Some stupid fucking cosmic lottery

20:27.311 --> 20:29.981
decided that we're the ones
that get to save the world.

20:32.733 --> 20:34.276
Shit is terrifying.

20:34.902 --> 20:35.903
[Cole] You wanna know
the last thing I did

20:35.987 --> 20:36.988
before coming here?

20:37.071 --> 20:40.449
I said goodbye to my wife
and my little girl.

20:40.533 --> 20:43.703
The two most important things
in my life.

20:43.786 --> 20:45.162
And there's a damn good chance

20:45.246 --> 20:46.664
I'm never gonna see them again.

20:48.499 --> 20:49.542
And I'm okay with that.

20:50.960 --> 20:53.796
Because I know if I die out there,
I'm dying for them.

20:55.214 --> 20:57.925
We lose one more time,
the Earth is gone.

20:58.009 --> 21:00.511
[Liu Kang] And our only chance
is to face this together.

21:01.095 --> 21:05.474
You, Johnny Cage,
are a part of this now.

21:10.646 --> 21:14.358
[heroic music builds, stops]

21:14.442 --> 21:15.609
Fuck that.

21:15.693 --> 21:17.278
[Sonya] Johnny, even if you walk away,

21:17.361 --> 21:19.113
the Elder Gods
can still summon you to fight.

21:19.196 --> 21:20.281
Not if they can't find me.

21:20.364 --> 21:22.033
So what are you gonna do, huh?

21:22.116 --> 21:23.492
You just going to go hide?

21:23.576 --> 21:25.619
No, first I'm gonna drink
every beer on the planet,

21:25.703 --> 21:26.787
then I'm going to hide.

21:26.871 --> 21:28.622
Because this shit's
got nothing to do with me.

21:28.706 --> 21:30.708
I'm not some great warrior.

21:30.791 --> 21:32.293
I'm not some champion.

21:32.376 --> 21:34.420
Okay? I'm an actor.

21:34.503 --> 21:35.504
[Sonya] Hmm.

21:36.797 --> 21:38.090
And before that, you were the guy

21:38.174 --> 21:40.384
with five black belts and a world title.

21:42.386 --> 21:45.139
Yeah, I saw some of those old fights.

21:46.223 --> 21:49.435
Man, you could have been
one of the best.

21:49.518 --> 21:52.313
But I wasn't.
And that was a long time ago.

21:52.396 --> 21:55.191
That guy you want is dead and buried.

21:56.192 --> 21:58.444
Or maybe he's still in there,
trying to get out.

22:19.006 --> 22:20.007
Hey, listen...

22:22.093 --> 22:24.261
I'm like 90% sure I had an aneurysm

22:24.345 --> 22:26.680
and this is some kind of
fucked up coma dream,

22:28.849 --> 22:30.726
but on the off chance this shit is real,

22:32.394 --> 22:34.438
best of luck with the whole
saving the world thing.

22:39.902 --> 22:41.445
[thunderclap]

22:41.529 --> 22:43.197
[thunder rumbling]

22:47.159 --> 22:49.954
[voices whispering]

22:50.037 --> 22:53.207
[Quan Chi] You should know
that when you died,

22:53.290 --> 22:57.628
it was not your so-called friends
who brought you back.

22:58.796 --> 23:01.006
It was not Lord Raiden,

23:01.799 --> 23:03.676
the Great Pretender.

23:05.636 --> 23:07.680
It was Shao Kahn.

23:09.098 --> 23:10.766
Rise now,

23:11.642 --> 23:15.271
as a champion of Outworld.

23:15.354 --> 23:17.773
[ominous music builds]

23:21.902 --> 23:25.197
[Acolyte] Sire,
we retrieved the package.

23:27.616 --> 23:28.617
Quan Chi!

23:29.451 --> 23:31.912
I am told you sent your
followers to Earthrealm.

23:31.996 --> 23:33.164
What were they doing there?

23:33.247 --> 23:36.167
Simply retrieving
some lost property, my lady.

23:37.042 --> 23:38.836
By order of your father.

23:41.463 --> 23:42.464
What is that?

23:47.094 --> 23:48.888
[Quan Chi] I believe it's called...

23:49.805 --> 23:51.015
a "Kano."

23:56.061 --> 23:57.813
[man] One Sling Dog please.

24:00.566 --> 24:01.567
[gasps]

24:03.569 --> 24:04.737
You're Johnny Cage.

24:05.863 --> 24:07.531
That's what the tab says.

24:07.615 --> 24:09.158
[man] Holy shit.

24:09.700 --> 24:13.162
I freaking loved Citizen Cage
when I was a kid.

24:15.039 --> 24:16.624
Thanks, man. I appreciate it.

24:18.667 --> 24:20.085
Dude, you know what they should do?

24:21.378 --> 24:23.422
They should do another Citizen Cage.

24:23.505 --> 24:24.924
Like a reboot.

24:25.925 --> 24:27.843
Come on, man. Give me a break.

24:28.469 --> 24:29.345
Nobody wants that.

24:30.137 --> 24:30.971
What?

24:31.055 --> 24:32.223
You think the world is crying out

24:32.306 --> 24:35.351
for a Johnny Cage comeback? Huh?

24:36.268 --> 24:38.687
No. They want gritty,
they want grounded,

24:38.771 --> 24:39.688
they want Keanu Reeves

24:39.772 --> 24:41.941
murdering a thousand
fucking dudes with a pencil.

24:42.024 --> 24:43.859
That's what people wanna see.

24:45.778 --> 24:49.573
Not some dinosaur
doing a bunch of karate poses.

24:50.866 --> 24:52.618
That shit went out in the '90s.

24:56.747 --> 24:58.207
I thought it was pretty cool.

25:09.176 --> 25:10.469
[sighs]

25:19.353 --> 25:21.689
[Quan Chi chanting indistinctly]

25:24.942 --> 25:27.027
[unsettling music playing]

25:33.659 --> 25:35.661
[continues chanting]

25:38.122 --> 25:39.540
[Kano screams]

25:43.711 --> 25:45.462
Where's my fucking eye?

25:46.255 --> 25:47.965
-[squelching]
-[Kano grunts]

25:49.591 --> 25:50.676
Blondie.

25:52.094 --> 25:53.512
[Raiden] The tournament has begun.

25:54.513 --> 25:56.181
Today you fight for Earthrealm.

25:56.265 --> 25:58.350
For the lives of everyone
you have ever known.

25:58.434 --> 26:01.729
If you fail, the Earth fails with you.

26:02.438 --> 26:05.399
Two of our champions
will be chosen to compete today.

26:06.066 --> 26:07.067
The winners will advance

26:07.151 --> 26:08.861
to the next stage of the tournament.

26:09.486 --> 26:11.864
The losers will be eliminated.

26:11.947 --> 26:13.407
To the death.

26:13.490 --> 26:15.284
That is up to the winner.

26:16.243 --> 26:17.286
Maybe don't lose.

26:17.911 --> 26:19.455
[energy whooshing]

26:21.123 --> 26:22.124
[pulsing]

26:23.208 --> 26:25.377
Well, looks like it's my lucky day.

26:25.461 --> 26:27.504
Blade, you got this.

26:33.761 --> 26:35.596
I thought you said
two of us were fighting.

26:37.139 --> 26:39.183
[rock music playing over stereo]

26:40.351 --> 26:43.937
[announcer] It's Johnny Cage
with a brutal hit. He's down.

26:44.021 --> 26:45.939
-[whistle blows]
-[announcer] It's official.

26:46.023 --> 26:48.650
Johnny Cage just became
the youngest minor

26:48.734 --> 26:50.277
to ever win this tournament.

26:50.361 --> 26:52.863
This young man
is destined for greatness.

26:56.825 --> 26:58.369
[bartender] You seem
a little down, Johnny.

26:59.495 --> 27:01.330
You're normally a little more animated.

27:08.253 --> 27:09.671
Uno más, thanks, Ed.

27:13.258 --> 27:14.259
[zaps]

27:20.057 --> 27:21.392
[grunts]

27:30.067 --> 27:31.360
Oh, shit.

27:32.528 --> 27:34.696
[suspenseful music playing]

27:37.366 --> 27:38.534
I don't know what you're on about.

27:38.617 --> 27:39.743
The amulet of what now?

27:39.827 --> 27:41.703
Shinnok. Pay attention!

27:41.787 --> 27:43.372
Don't look at me
with that tone of voice,

27:43.455 --> 27:44.832
you big bleached dildo.

27:44.915 --> 27:47.668
I've just been dead.
And my fucking eye's AWOL.

27:47.751 --> 27:50.963
Stop your incessant whinging.
We can build you another.

27:51.046 --> 27:53.090
Why is he not a Revenant
like the rest of them?

27:53.173 --> 27:55.509
[Quan Chi] He was not worth
the time or the effort.

27:55.592 --> 27:58.220
This one barely has a soul
left to corrupt.

27:58.303 --> 28:00.639
Ha! You hear that? A fucking loophole.

28:00.722 --> 28:02.057
[laughs] Go, you good thing.

28:02.141 --> 28:05.310
Where is the amulet you took
from Raiden's temple?

28:05.394 --> 28:06.895
I don't know, probably in my pocket

28:06.979 --> 28:08.313
where I keep all the shit I steal.

28:10.065 --> 28:11.692
Oh, right-oh.

28:14.111 --> 28:17.489
-Here we go. How about...
-[metal clinking]

28:18.157 --> 28:20.117
Nah, different temple. Well, hold on.

28:21.076 --> 28:22.077
This could be...

28:22.578 --> 28:24.496
[chuckles] Yeah. Should call her.

28:25.456 --> 28:28.500
Ah! Here we are. Yahtzee.

28:29.126 --> 28:30.085
Oi!

28:30.169 --> 28:31.378
We could have left him dead.

28:31.462 --> 28:33.213
Hey! First off, fuck off.

28:33.297 --> 28:35.132
And you, where are you going with that?

28:36.383 --> 28:38.010
I will take it to my father.

28:39.344 --> 28:40.721
Unfortunately, Princess,

28:40.804 --> 28:43.140
it appears you are needed elsewhere.

28:45.476 --> 28:47.060
Oi, you creepy fucking mime.

28:47.144 --> 28:49.021
I stole that fair and square.

28:50.397 --> 28:51.773
Good luck.

28:58.614 --> 29:00.574
[footsteps thudding]

29:04.244 --> 29:06.330
[thrilling music playing]

29:12.503 --> 29:14.379
[Kitana] Each flame
represents a fighter.

29:15.172 --> 29:16.673
The tournament ends when one side

29:16.757 --> 29:18.258
has no champions left.

29:19.134 --> 29:21.094
Hey. How's it going, babe?

29:21.178 --> 29:22.930
[blades clanking]

29:23.013 --> 29:25.432
Listen, I'm warning you,

29:26.433 --> 29:29.394
I got a Saturn Award
for best fight in a feature film,

29:29.478 --> 29:30.729
so don't mess with me.

29:31.230 --> 29:32.940
[gong tolls]

29:34.858 --> 29:37.402
Whoa! Whoa. Easy, all right?

29:37.486 --> 29:39.821
Let's just take a timeout here
and talk about it.

29:39.905 --> 29:42.658
Okay? I really don't feel
comfortable hitting a girl.

29:44.201 --> 29:46.495
Don't worry, you won't.

29:52.334 --> 29:54.169
[blades slashing]

29:56.046 --> 29:57.965
[both grunting]

29:58.048 --> 29:59.883
Whoa! Come on. Easy.
Let's just talk about this.

30:04.346 --> 30:06.223
-[grunts]
-[thuds]

30:22.864 --> 30:24.324
Why are you so fucking mean?

30:24.408 --> 30:25.534
[Kitana scoffs]

30:27.160 --> 30:29.371
[panting]

30:35.043 --> 30:36.878
[Johnny grunting]

30:49.683 --> 30:50.684
[both grunting]

30:51.602 --> 30:52.603
[Kitana grunts]

31:15.459 --> 31:16.668
[grunts]

31:19.713 --> 31:20.964
[sighs]

31:21.048 --> 31:23.008
[thrilling music continues]

31:38.607 --> 31:40.609
[blades slashing]

31:44.321 --> 31:45.322
[grunts]

31:48.492 --> 31:50.619
-[blades slash]
-[groans]

31:59.961 --> 32:00.962
[Johnny grunts]

32:06.593 --> 32:07.469
[groans]

32:16.645 --> 32:18.313
Finish him!

32:32.661 --> 32:33.662
Hmm.

32:49.553 --> 32:51.638
[suspenseful music playing]

32:57.853 --> 33:00.439
[Sindel] It appears your side
is already down a man.

33:01.648 --> 33:02.691
Tragic.

33:05.652 --> 33:06.695
And who are you?

33:07.195 --> 33:09.823
Sindel. High Queen of Edenia.

33:09.906 --> 33:12.200
Consort to the great Shao Kahn.

33:12.284 --> 33:14.202
They send their queen to fight?

33:14.703 --> 33:17.914
No. We send our best to fight.

33:17.998 --> 33:18.915
Oh.

33:19.666 --> 33:22.127
No offense, babe,
but you look really fucking dead.

33:22.210 --> 33:24.421
I was freed from my mortal bonds.

33:24.504 --> 33:25.630
Shao Kahn showed me

33:25.714 --> 33:27.382
the pleasures of a life eternal.

33:27.466 --> 33:29.050
-[gong tolls]
-[metal clanks]

33:32.053 --> 33:33.972
Perhaps I'll do the same for you.

33:34.055 --> 33:35.265
[metal clanking]

33:39.603 --> 33:40.479
[Sonya yells]

33:43.857 --> 33:45.150
What a pretty trick.

33:46.234 --> 33:47.778
Would you like to see mine?

33:48.653 --> 33:50.280
No, actually I'm good.

33:51.448 --> 33:53.700
-[grunts]
-[screaming]

33:58.121 --> 33:59.748
[yelling]

34:03.794 --> 34:04.878
[grunts]

34:04.961 --> 34:05.962
[metal slashing]

34:11.176 --> 34:13.303
[screaming]

34:13.428 --> 34:15.764
[Sonya] Fuck you! You stupid bitch!

34:18.975 --> 34:19.976
[grunts]

34:26.566 --> 34:27.567
[grunts]

34:29.236 --> 34:30.195
[groans]

34:33.198 --> 34:35.534
[both straining]

34:35.617 --> 34:36.535
[Sindel growling]

34:41.581 --> 34:43.542
[screaming]

34:44.292 --> 34:45.293
[thuds]

34:51.842 --> 34:53.844
[Sonya grunting]

35:00.141 --> 35:02.602
[both straining]

35:02.686 --> 35:04.479
[screaming]

35:10.569 --> 35:11.528
[Sonya grunts]

35:16.491 --> 35:17.492
[squelches]

35:19.744 --> 35:20.745
[panting]

35:22.706 --> 35:24.583
It appears our sides are now even.

35:30.171 --> 35:31.381
What'd I miss? [sighs]

35:32.090 --> 35:34.217
Fuck yeah! Look who's back.

35:36.177 --> 35:38.013
Well? How bad was it?

35:38.096 --> 35:41.808
Zombie queen. Pit of spikes. Yeah.

35:41.892 --> 35:43.393
-So pretty goddamn bad.
-Ow.

35:43.476 --> 35:45.437
-[Johnny groans]
-[Sonya grunts]

35:45.520 --> 35:46.730
-You okay?
-Yeah.

35:51.026 --> 35:52.152
What happened?

35:52.235 --> 35:54.529
You were eliminated from the tournament.

35:55.655 --> 35:56.740
You lost.

35:56.823 --> 35:59.618
You are lucky, she was charitable
and let you live.

36:07.542 --> 36:09.294
[Kano] Oi! Pennywise.

36:09.377 --> 36:11.588
I've been looking all over
this shithole for you.

36:11.671 --> 36:13.214
You promised me a new eye.

36:13.298 --> 36:14.925
And it better be one that shoots lasers.

36:15.467 --> 36:18.470
-I have other priorities.
-[Kano] Like fucking what?

36:18.553 --> 36:20.013
If it's putting on more eyeliner,

36:20.096 --> 36:21.556
trust me, you're good.

36:21.640 --> 36:22.933
All right? Come on, mate.

36:23.016 --> 36:25.477
I am bumping into shit
left, right, and center.

36:25.560 --> 36:27.270
I mean, my peripheral vision is fucked.

36:27.354 --> 36:29.105
Proper fucked, mate.

36:29.189 --> 36:31.107
So come on. Chop-chop. Let's get to it.

36:31.191 --> 36:32.776
[pulsing]

36:32.859 --> 36:34.235
Well, you don't have to do it right now.

36:34.319 --> 36:37.030
I mean, you need to,
you know, take a measurement.

36:37.113 --> 36:40.367
Check the color
or wash your grubby little hands.

36:43.662 --> 36:45.038
All right, let's have a look.

36:45.121 --> 36:48.041
Don't fucking roll it on
the fucking ground, you grub!

36:49.501 --> 36:51.211
Oi, the amulet.

36:51.878 --> 36:54.464
I want that back.
And don't fucking roll it.

36:54.589 --> 36:57.258
[Quan Chi] You got your eye.
Now leave me alone.

36:57.342 --> 36:59.511
The amulet does not belong to you.

37:00.053 --> 37:01.930
Its powers are well beyond

37:02.013 --> 37:03.807
-your meager understanding.
-[blows air]

37:03.890 --> 37:04.891
Idiot.

37:04.975 --> 37:07.185
All right. Let's take
this baby for a test drive.

37:07.936 --> 37:10.021
All right. [inhales deeply]

37:11.147 --> 37:15.402
One, two, three. Oh! Fuck! Snug.

37:16.152 --> 37:18.697
[zapping]

37:18.780 --> 37:20.782
Wow. [chuckles]

37:20.865 --> 37:23.201
Holy shit, is that HD?
That's pretty good.

37:23.284 --> 37:25.745
How many eyes you made?
Can you do me other one?

37:38.883 --> 37:40.719
You seem troubled, Mr. Cage.

37:42.554 --> 37:44.681
Yeah. Well, 'cause of me

37:44.764 --> 37:47.100
Earth's odds just got 20% worse.

37:47.809 --> 37:50.020
I had a chance to actually
do something worth a damn

37:50.103 --> 37:51.688
and I screwed it all up.

37:51.771 --> 37:55.859
So, yeah, I'd say "troubled"
just about sums it up.

37:56.818 --> 37:58.403
[rustling]

38:04.117 --> 38:07.162
What are those? Pills?

38:07.245 --> 38:08.580
Huh?

38:09.539 --> 38:10.957
Are they magic fighting pills?

38:12.042 --> 38:14.252
Is that...
Is that how you get your powers?

38:21.259 --> 38:22.802
[clattering]

38:23.678 --> 38:24.721
Bird seed.

38:26.347 --> 38:29.434
Oh. Yeah, yeah, yeah. Bird seed. Yeah.

38:30.727 --> 38:34.147
Well, I thought you were gonna
give me some kind of lecture,

38:34.230 --> 38:37.734
but yeah, chores are good.

38:40.612 --> 38:42.155
You don't need a lecture.

38:42.238 --> 38:43.948
You need perspective.

38:44.032 --> 38:46.701
[scoffs] Perspective, huh?

38:46.785 --> 38:49.037
There are eight billion people
on this planet

38:49.120 --> 38:51.247
and yet the gods chose you.

38:51.331 --> 38:53.333
Perhaps they saw your true potential

38:53.416 --> 38:55.001
-as a champion of Earthrealm.
-[sighs]

38:55.877 --> 38:57.420
Maybe they made a mistake.

38:57.504 --> 38:58.338
Maybe.

38:58.880 --> 39:02.008
If I see the Elder Gods,
I'll be sure to tell them.

39:06.763 --> 39:08.890
Well, I'm glad
you find this all so amusing.

39:10.141 --> 39:13.645
Hey, great pep talk, by the way.
Just nailed it.

39:18.483 --> 39:20.568
[pensive music playing]

39:26.449 --> 39:28.451
[rumbling]

39:43.633 --> 39:45.635
[crackling]

39:48.138 --> 39:50.098
[thunder crashing]

39:59.607 --> 40:00.608
Ouch.

40:02.068 --> 40:03.653
You have done this before?

40:04.654 --> 40:05.905
I've seen it done.

40:07.907 --> 40:09.242
[Sonya] All right.

40:14.372 --> 40:18.001
It's okay. The Princess Kitana
has been my eyes and ears

40:18.084 --> 40:20.044
inside the palace for many years now.

40:21.880 --> 40:23.840
We know the risk you took coming here.

40:23.923 --> 40:25.091
Thank you, Kitana.

40:25.175 --> 40:27.427
Wait, are you telling me
I got my ass kicked

40:27.510 --> 40:28.678
by one of the good guys?

40:28.803 --> 40:31.472
I had to make it look real.
He was watching.

40:32.640 --> 40:34.726
They found the Amulet of Shinnok.

40:34.809 --> 40:35.810
It was in the possession

40:35.894 --> 40:37.395
of a dead sellsword named Kano.

40:37.979 --> 40:39.606
Son of a bitch.

40:39.689 --> 40:41.357
If the Emperor finds a way
to charge the amulet,

40:41.441 --> 40:43.026
he would be unstoppable.

40:43.109 --> 40:44.819
It would be like fighting a god.

40:44.903 --> 40:47.363
Yeah, well, let's not do that.

40:48.156 --> 40:49.824
My friend is in the tournament.

40:51.075 --> 40:52.577
Jade was raised under Shao Kahn's army.

40:53.661 --> 40:57.540
Do what you must,
but do not make her suffer.

40:58.958 --> 41:00.251
[crackling]

41:09.844 --> 41:11.554
You went to another realm?

41:14.140 --> 41:15.642
You followed me?

41:15.725 --> 41:17.936
I am trying to keep you alive.

41:18.019 --> 41:19.020
By spying on your friend.

41:19.103 --> 41:21.731
By keeping my friend
from making a mistake.

41:21.814 --> 41:24.859
You are conspiring
with Lord Raiden. The enemy.

41:25.526 --> 41:27.612
I swore an oath, Kitana.

41:28.446 --> 41:31.950
To serve as Shao Kahn's sword.

41:39.582 --> 41:41.417
[Raiden] The second round
of the tournament

41:41.501 --> 41:43.002
will consist of three matches.

41:43.878 --> 41:46.714
Jax, Cole, Liu Kang.

41:53.930 --> 41:55.431
[metal slashes]

42:00.270 --> 42:01.271
[gasps]

42:04.065 --> 42:05.233
Kung Lao.

42:06.651 --> 42:08.361
I have been given new life.

42:09.612 --> 42:10.863
My son?

42:12.699 --> 42:13.783
[chiming]

42:14.784 --> 42:16.077
[energy pulsing]

42:20.123 --> 42:23.584
Look at that.
Still part of this tournament.

42:23.668 --> 42:25.420
But that's not why I'm here.

42:26.963 --> 42:29.215
[ominous choral music playing]

42:34.345 --> 42:36.306
No!

42:36.389 --> 42:37.515
No!

42:45.273 --> 42:46.858
[groaning]

42:49.152 --> 42:50.445
Attack now!

42:54.032 --> 42:55.241
[Sonya grunting]

42:55.992 --> 42:57.910
[tense music playing]

43:00.663 --> 43:01.664
[grunts]

43:05.543 --> 43:07.545
[choking]

43:18.431 --> 43:20.600
[grunting]

43:25.271 --> 43:26.898
[zaps]

43:28.816 --> 43:33.571
Imagine what one could do
with such power.

43:35.198 --> 43:39.535
[Shao Kahn] Careful, Sorcerer,
that doesn't belong to you.

43:47.126 --> 43:50.171
The amulet must be bound
to a mortal soul.

43:50.254 --> 43:52.131
Once it has imprinted on you,

43:52.215 --> 43:54.175
Raiden's power will be yours.

43:54.759 --> 43:57.136
The amulet will give you immortality.

43:57.220 --> 43:59.013
[amulet pulsing]

43:59.097 --> 44:01.224
[dramatic music playing]

44:02.058 --> 44:03.643
[Shao Kahn grunting]

44:09.399 --> 44:10.817
[Shao Kahn growls]

44:18.783 --> 44:21.661
[inhales, growls]

44:25.748 --> 44:27.708
[bubbling]

44:29.043 --> 44:31.045
[gate rattling]

44:31.129 --> 44:33.047
[suspenseful music playing]

44:36.926 --> 44:38.553
[growls]

44:56.362 --> 44:58.156
[portal whooshing]

45:01.075 --> 45:04.370
Well, this is fucking ominous.

45:06.789 --> 45:08.249
[portal whooshing]

45:11.377 --> 45:13.171
I'm guessing you're Jade.

45:13.254 --> 45:15.089
[Jade] Let's get this over with.

45:15.882 --> 45:16.883
[clangs]

45:18.676 --> 45:20.386
[suit pulsing]

45:20.470 --> 45:23.306
I am told you carry
the blood of Scorpion.

45:27.560 --> 45:29.353
I look forward to spilling it.

45:32.565 --> 45:33.399
[Jax yells]

45:44.243 --> 45:46.120
You know you're fighting
on the wrong side, right?

45:47.205 --> 45:48.206
[grunts]

45:54.921 --> 45:57.131
[staff clangs, pulsing]

45:57.215 --> 45:58.841
What the fuck do you have under there?

46:00.092 --> 46:01.719
Shit. [yells]

46:14.148 --> 46:15.525
[panting]

46:16.025 --> 46:17.068
[yells]

46:22.156 --> 46:23.074
Well, hello there.

46:25.701 --> 46:26.702
[yelling]

46:31.874 --> 46:34.210
[Shao Kahn] I hope
your ancestors are watching.

46:36.379 --> 46:38.089
[thrilling music playing]

46:46.472 --> 46:47.473
[Cole yells]

46:47.557 --> 46:48.975
[metal clangs]

46:51.185 --> 46:52.687
-[yells]
-[Shao Kahn grunts]

46:55.273 --> 46:56.607
[growls]

46:59.151 --> 47:00.194
[yells]

47:03.155 --> 47:04.198
[Jade yells]

47:06.033 --> 47:09.203
For what it is worth,
I take no joy in this.

47:12.123 --> 47:14.125
Then you're really going
to hate this shit.

47:15.251 --> 47:17.295
-[yells]
-[groans]

47:17.795 --> 47:18.796
[coughs]

47:19.505 --> 47:20.923
This is for my family.

47:22.216 --> 47:23.175
For my friends.

47:24.343 --> 47:25.803
For every moment that brought me here.

47:27.221 --> 47:30.558
This is for Earth, you son of a bitch.

47:32.059 --> 47:33.728
[dramatic choral music playing]

47:36.522 --> 47:37.857
[Cole grunts]

47:43.613 --> 47:44.822
[Shao Kahn grunts]

47:44.905 --> 47:46.324
[armor clanging]

47:48.451 --> 47:50.620
-[blade slicing]
-[blood splattering]

48:03.174 --> 48:04.467
[strains]

48:05.676 --> 48:07.094
[groans]

48:07.178 --> 48:09.180
[suit pulsing, powering up]

48:11.932 --> 48:13.309
[Shao Kahn screams]

48:14.226 --> 48:15.394
[Shao Kahn groans in pain]

48:15.478 --> 48:17.480
[squelching]

48:19.148 --> 48:20.107
[Cole] What?

48:20.608 --> 48:23.110
[Shao Kahn laughs]

48:24.278 --> 48:25.488
[gasps]

48:25.571 --> 48:26.822
[Shao Kahn yells]

48:28.991 --> 48:31.619
-[gasps]
-[squelching]

48:35.039 --> 48:36.624
[grunts]

48:42.546 --> 48:44.173
[liquid sizzles]

48:45.007 --> 48:46.801
Give my regards to the dead.

48:47.968 --> 48:48.969
[weapon splashing]

48:49.637 --> 48:51.055
[groans]

48:51.138 --> 48:52.682
[grunts, pants]

48:55.893 --> 48:58.521
Go on, do it.

49:22.211 --> 49:23.212
Why?

49:24.171 --> 49:25.840
Your friend spared one of our guys.

49:27.258 --> 49:28.175
Now we're even.

49:29.135 --> 49:31.846
By the way, hell of a fight.

49:34.598 --> 49:36.976
[energy warbling]

49:40.563 --> 49:42.481
[portal whooshing]

49:47.027 --> 49:49.363
[blade whirring, vibrating]

49:54.660 --> 49:57.621
Kung Lao, what have they done to you?

49:58.205 --> 50:00.082
Opened my eyes to the truth.

50:03.043 --> 50:04.044
What truth?

50:04.670 --> 50:08.674
Look around. The gods have
abandoned their creation.

50:09.592 --> 50:11.927
Only Shao Kahn can save us now.

50:12.887 --> 50:16.098
One of those gods raised you. Loved you.

50:17.516 --> 50:18.976
And you slit his throat.

50:22.146 --> 50:23.481
[grunts]

50:24.273 --> 50:25.232
[thuds]

50:25.316 --> 50:27.109
[tense music playing]

51:16.867 --> 51:18.285
[scraping]

51:22.957 --> 51:24.792
-[growls]
-[Liu Kang grunts]

51:24.875 --> 51:28.504
Stop. Kung Lao, remember who you are!

51:30.381 --> 51:31.966
You were my brother.

51:32.049 --> 51:34.760
And when you're dead,
when your realm falls,

51:35.469 --> 51:37.304
we will be brothers again.

51:37.388 --> 51:38.389
[straining]

51:39.598 --> 51:40.599
[grunts]

51:46.939 --> 51:49.024
[sinister choral music playing]

52:02.872 --> 52:04.290
Don't make me do this.

52:07.376 --> 52:09.003
[thrilling music playing]

52:38.616 --> 52:39.783
[straining]

52:40.993 --> 52:41.994
[grunts]

52:42.077 --> 52:43.996
[dramatic choral music playing]

53:06.560 --> 53:07.519
[clangs]

53:08.812 --> 53:09.813
[thuds]

53:15.110 --> 53:16.111
[whirring]

53:25.663 --> 53:27.122
I'll find a way to save you.

53:28.457 --> 53:29.458
[grunts]

53:32.211 --> 53:33.420
[grinding]

53:40.511 --> 53:42.429
I'm going to bring you back.

53:52.856 --> 53:53.857
[blow thuds]

53:56.735 --> 53:57.736
[squelching]

53:57.820 --> 53:59.613
[gurgling]

54:04.410 --> 54:06.412
[grinding stops]

54:11.250 --> 54:12.668
[groans, shudders]

54:18.132 --> 54:21.093
But not today, brother.

54:30.185 --> 54:32.021
[somber music playing]

54:40.946 --> 54:42.656
-[crackling]
-Raiden!

54:47.536 --> 54:50.706
-Is he?
-He's alive. Barely.

54:56.462 --> 54:57.921
He's been asking for you.

55:00.090 --> 55:01.091
[weakly] Liu Kang.

55:08.140 --> 55:09.183
My son.

55:09.767 --> 55:10.768
[exhales]

55:19.610 --> 55:20.611
What happened?

55:23.322 --> 55:24.364
I killed him.

55:25.657 --> 55:26.867
I didn't have a choice.

55:27.701 --> 55:28.702
I'm sorry.

55:33.290 --> 55:34.333
Where's Cole?

55:36.710 --> 55:37.920
He didn't come back?

55:41.131 --> 55:42.758
Oh, shit.

55:45.177 --> 55:46.095
[sighs]

55:54.728 --> 55:55.979
[Shao Kahn] Necromancer,

55:57.022 --> 55:59.274
give me your greatest warrior.

56:00.734 --> 56:02.736
The one they call Sub-Zero.

56:05.155 --> 56:07.157
[echoing] Bi-Han.

56:17.126 --> 56:18.961
[Quan Chi] Rise now.

56:22.214 --> 56:24.133
[sinister music playing]

56:31.431 --> 56:33.058
[Bi-Han] I am reborn.

56:34.268 --> 56:35.269
[crackling]

56:43.819 --> 56:46.113
[Kitana] Raiden's portal
is already weakening.

56:46.697 --> 56:48.574
It will not last when he is gone.

56:48.657 --> 56:50.242
Why would they take his powers?

56:50.325 --> 56:52.286
Shao Kahn has bonded with the amulet.

56:52.369 --> 56:54.079
Stolen the powers of a god.

56:54.163 --> 56:55.956
The only way to reverse the process

56:56.039 --> 56:57.583
is to destroy the amulet.

56:57.666 --> 56:59.918
Well, we'd better do it
before the next round starts.

57:00.002 --> 57:01.003
[Jax] Mm-hmm.

57:01.086 --> 57:02.838
[Johnny] So, let's use the portal.

57:02.921 --> 57:06.258
Jump in, we grab the amulet
of magic bullshit, destroy it,

57:06.341 --> 57:07.426
and then get the fuck out of there

57:07.509 --> 57:09.136
before he even knows we're there.

57:09.219 --> 57:11.180
The palace has defensive wards in place.

57:11.805 --> 57:13.891
Open a portal
and they'll sense you at once.

57:14.683 --> 57:15.934
So where does that leave us?

57:23.192 --> 57:25.736
There is a tunnel beneath the castle.

57:26.820 --> 57:27.738
It is the only entrance

57:27.821 --> 57:30.073
that is not under constant watch.

57:30.157 --> 57:31.200
Because?

57:31.283 --> 57:33.118
Because it is the service entrance

57:33.202 --> 57:34.411
for the Tarkatans.

57:34.494 --> 57:35.704
[chuckles]

57:37.581 --> 57:39.458
What's a Tarkatan?

57:46.215 --> 57:47.549
What?

57:51.345 --> 57:53.138
[portal rumbling]

57:57.100 --> 57:59.102
[whispering indistinctly]

58:16.495 --> 58:18.497
[whispering indistinctly]

58:22.167 --> 58:23.252
[growls]

58:30.592 --> 58:32.886
[gate opens]

58:40.811 --> 58:42.145
Wait, what did you do?

58:42.229 --> 58:44.481
I did not do this, Kitana.

58:45.148 --> 58:46.149
You did.

58:47.818 --> 58:49.736
[ominous music playing]

58:50.779 --> 58:52.114
Wait, Jade. Jade.

58:55.784 --> 58:57.786
[Tarkatans whispering]

59:07.838 --> 59:10.048
Are you the leader of this clan?

59:13.844 --> 59:14.845
I am Baraka.

59:14.928 --> 59:16.680
[Tarkatans cheering, snarling]

59:18.056 --> 59:19.308
I am Liu Kang.

59:24.062 --> 59:26.857
I know how your people have suffered

59:26.940 --> 59:28.483
at the hands of Shao Kahn.

59:29.151 --> 59:30.986
He uses you like slaves.

59:31.069 --> 59:34.239
He treats you like wild dogs.

59:37.159 --> 59:38.994
[Tarkatans clamoring]

59:40.704 --> 59:42.289
We are wild dogs.

59:42.831 --> 59:45.459
We have come to end Shao Kahn's reign.

59:47.336 --> 59:48.378
Will you help us?

59:50.380 --> 59:51.882
Shao Kahn has an army.

59:52.716 --> 59:54.092
Do you have an army?

59:54.176 --> 59:55.427
No.

59:55.510 --> 59:57.220
Then you're wasting my time.

59:58.013 --> 59:59.598
[Tarkatans snarling]

01:00:03.769 --> 01:00:05.145
[Liu Kang] Then I challenge you,

01:00:05.228 --> 01:00:08.815
Baraka of Clan Tarkata,
to single combat.

01:00:08.899 --> 01:00:10.525
I decline your challenge.

01:00:11.443 --> 01:00:12.569
Now leave.

01:00:19.659 --> 01:00:21.244
You know, everyone keeps talking

01:00:21.328 --> 01:00:23.330
Tarkatan this, Tarkatan that.

01:00:23.413 --> 01:00:26.666
Big teeth, stabby arms, ooh, scary.

01:00:27.709 --> 01:00:28.877
No one mentioned the fact that

01:00:29.002 --> 01:00:30.629
you're all a bunch
of giant fucking pussies.

01:00:30.712 --> 01:00:32.297
[Baraka growls]

01:00:32.381 --> 01:00:34.049
All right, maybe don't insult
the monsters.

01:00:37.844 --> 01:00:40.263
I mean, do you have any idea
who you're talking to?

01:00:41.640 --> 01:00:43.433
I'm Johnny fucking Cage.

01:00:44.059 --> 01:00:46.478
And this guy is Liu Kang.

01:00:46.561 --> 01:00:48.230
Earth's greatest champion.

01:00:48.772 --> 01:00:52.484
I mean, look, man, I get it.
I'd be scared of him too.

01:00:52.567 --> 01:00:55.987
But someday, when Shao Kahn's dead

01:00:56.071 --> 01:00:58.365
and Outworld's been defeated,

01:00:58.448 --> 01:01:00.867
you're going to have to tell
all your little

01:01:00.951 --> 01:01:03.453
Spirit Halloween monster grandbabies

01:01:03.537 --> 01:01:06.832
that you had the chance
to fight the great Liu Kang,

01:01:07.874 --> 01:01:09.626
but you were too much of a coward.

01:01:09.709 --> 01:01:12.129
[Tarkatans growling]

01:01:18.844 --> 01:01:20.345
I accept your challenge.

01:01:21.346 --> 01:01:22.347
Okay.

01:01:24.057 --> 01:01:25.517
[Liu Kang] Thanks for making him angry.

01:01:31.940 --> 01:01:34.192
Hollywood Negotiating 101.

01:01:40.699 --> 01:01:41.741
But not him.

01:01:42.868 --> 01:01:45.328
My fight is with you.

01:01:45.412 --> 01:01:46.496
Oh, boy.

01:01:46.580 --> 01:01:47.581
Me?

01:01:48.832 --> 01:01:50.167
Well, what did I do?

01:01:50.250 --> 01:01:51.751
I find you annoying,

01:01:52.794 --> 01:01:54.963
and I wish to kill you and eat you.

01:01:55.881 --> 01:01:58.675
That would bring me
immense satisfaction.

01:02:03.096 --> 01:02:04.139
Is this guy serious?

01:02:04.222 --> 01:02:05.223
Uh-huh.

01:02:05.807 --> 01:02:08.560
Guys, I'm just a fucking actor, okay?

01:02:09.478 --> 01:02:12.272
Johnny Cage is just
a character I play. All right?

01:02:12.355 --> 01:02:14.232
I have stuntmen
that do this shit for me.

01:02:14.316 --> 01:02:16.693
-You're gonna have to do it.
-Oh, no, no, no.

01:02:18.820 --> 01:02:20.822
Johnny will definitely die.

01:02:21.490 --> 01:02:22.657
Oh, agreed. You're going to die.

01:02:22.741 --> 01:02:24.910
Yeah, agreed. Hard agree!

01:02:24.993 --> 01:02:27.120
-[Baraka growls]
-One minute, bub.

01:02:27.913 --> 01:02:29.956
Guys, you saw me in the tournament.

01:02:30.040 --> 01:02:31.583
I... I can't do this.

01:02:31.666 --> 01:02:32.918
[Jax and Sonya] No shit.

01:02:33.627 --> 01:02:34.836
[Baraka] Enough!

01:02:35.504 --> 01:02:36.379
We fight.

01:02:37.339 --> 01:02:39.382
-[growls]
-Whoa, whoa, whoa.

01:02:39.466 --> 01:02:40.592
Let's set some ground rules, okay?

01:02:40.675 --> 01:02:41.676
Not the face.

01:02:41.760 --> 01:02:43.136
[Baraka snarls]

01:02:43.220 --> 01:02:44.471
[Johnny grunting]

01:02:52.604 --> 01:02:54.022
-[Baraka snarls]
-[grunts]

01:02:59.027 --> 01:03:00.237
[pants]

01:03:02.822 --> 01:03:05.283
Weapon! I need a weapon!

01:03:08.036 --> 01:03:09.079
Oh, shit.

01:03:09.162 --> 01:03:10.413
[grunts]

01:03:21.049 --> 01:03:22.676
[panting]

01:03:24.761 --> 01:03:25.762
Ugh.

01:03:33.478 --> 01:03:35.438
Shh.

01:03:43.238 --> 01:03:44.281
[Johnny] Oh, come on.

01:03:45.282 --> 01:03:46.741
[yells]

01:03:51.788 --> 01:03:54.499
[both grunting]

01:04:05.635 --> 01:04:07.220
-Oh.
-[snarls]

01:04:08.013 --> 01:04:10.515
[crashes]

01:04:20.066 --> 01:04:21.151
[Johnny grunts]

01:04:31.244 --> 01:04:32.454
[Johnny] Now stay down!

01:04:33.788 --> 01:04:35.457
[growling]

01:04:35.540 --> 01:04:36.499
Oh, shit.

01:04:36.583 --> 01:04:37.834
[yelling]

01:04:39.169 --> 01:04:42.297
-[screaming]
-[thuds]

01:04:44.799 --> 01:04:46.718
[roars]

01:04:47.302 --> 01:04:49.262
[Johhny yelps, groans]

01:04:52.349 --> 01:04:54.434
Well, this is a stupid ass way to lose.

01:04:55.310 --> 01:04:56.311
[Sonya] All right, get up.

01:04:56.811 --> 01:04:58.188
Get up.

01:05:04.319 --> 01:05:06.321
[heroic music playing]

01:05:16.414 --> 01:05:18.792
You're an actor, so act.

01:05:24.839 --> 01:05:26.675
All right, you big ugly fuck.

01:05:26.758 --> 01:05:27.759
[sunglasses clicks]

01:05:29.594 --> 01:05:31.137
["Mortal Kombat Theme" playing]

01:05:32.305 --> 01:05:34.057
It's showtime.

01:05:34.140 --> 01:05:35.392
[roars]

01:05:46.027 --> 01:05:47.070
[grunts]

01:05:47.153 --> 01:05:48.655
[roars]

01:05:55.870 --> 01:05:57.247
[roars]

01:06:03.420 --> 01:06:04.796
Come on, [mouthing] come on, come on.

01:06:13.388 --> 01:06:16.141
-[Baraka groans]
-[Johnny grunts]

01:06:25.024 --> 01:06:27.152
[growls]

01:06:39.998 --> 01:06:41.499
[groans]

01:06:41.583 --> 01:06:43.710
-Ooh!
-Goddamn!

01:06:43.793 --> 01:06:45.712
[groans, panting]

01:06:51.259 --> 01:06:52.260
[Baraka snarls]

01:06:53.219 --> 01:06:56.264
That... was the greatest fighting

01:06:56.347 --> 01:06:58.266
-I've ever seen!
-[Tarkatans cheering]

01:06:58.349 --> 01:07:01.144
Witness, my brothers and sisters.

01:07:02.729 --> 01:07:04.105
The cunning,

01:07:04.189 --> 01:07:06.357
the speed, the ferocity

01:07:06.441 --> 01:07:10.487
of the one they call
Johnny Fucking Cage.

01:07:10.570 --> 01:07:13.031
[triumphant music playing]

01:07:21.664 --> 01:07:23.792
You must share with me your knowledge.

01:07:25.293 --> 01:07:26.961
Mold me in your ways.

01:07:31.299 --> 01:07:33.760
And I will. I'll get right on that.

01:07:34.803 --> 01:07:39.098
But first, we need a little favor.

01:07:49.067 --> 01:07:51.236
-[Baraka growling]
-[blades slashing]

01:07:52.570 --> 01:07:53.571
[Baraka snarls]

01:08:08.086 --> 01:08:09.087
[yells]

01:08:12.590 --> 01:08:13.550
[body thuds]

01:08:13.633 --> 01:08:15.677
[Baraka] I've brought you
as far as I dare.

01:08:15.760 --> 01:08:18.638
Tarkatans are not allowed in the castle.

01:08:19.556 --> 01:08:20.557
Right.

01:08:21.558 --> 01:08:23.393
You have done well, my pupil.

01:08:24.936 --> 01:08:27.730
And someday I shall return, as promised,

01:08:28.690 --> 01:08:31.067
and we will complete your training.

01:08:31.150 --> 01:08:33.069
May the screams of your enemies

01:08:33.152 --> 01:08:34.988
echo in your dreams.

01:08:35.071 --> 01:08:38.032
And may their sweet fat
melt upon your tongue.

01:08:38.116 --> 01:08:39.993
Ah, yes. Mm.

01:08:40.869 --> 01:08:45.248
And, uh, the same with you
and... your enemies,

01:08:45.331 --> 01:08:47.125
and your tongue and the sweet fat

01:08:47.208 --> 01:08:49.794
[hesitates] be on your tongue too.

01:08:49.878 --> 01:08:53.631
As well. And... rock on.

01:08:57.218 --> 01:08:58.678
We're not going to make it in time.

01:08:59.512 --> 01:09:00.722
We have to try.

01:09:03.933 --> 01:09:05.059
[Jax] Let's go, baby.

01:09:12.901 --> 01:09:15.862
[Shao Kahn] So, what punishment
befits a wayward princess?

01:09:20.283 --> 01:09:21.576
As you can see,

01:09:22.535 --> 01:09:25.121
I ordered Quan Chi to resurrect her.

01:09:28.917 --> 01:09:31.628
But perhaps your mother should
have another accident.

01:09:39.594 --> 01:09:40.803
Stop.

01:09:41.638 --> 01:09:43.473
[Shao Kahn] It may be hard
to perform a resurrection

01:09:43.556 --> 01:09:45.934
when her skull is dripping
through my fingers.

01:09:46.017 --> 01:09:47.018
Please!

01:09:48.561 --> 01:09:50.063
Last chance, child.

01:09:50.146 --> 01:09:51.981
-Where did you go?
-Earthrealm!

01:09:55.151 --> 01:09:56.861
I went to Earthrealm.

01:10:02.200 --> 01:10:03.201
[Shao Kahn] Did you now?

01:10:04.160 --> 01:10:05.703
I went looking for Lord Raiden.

01:10:07.580 --> 01:10:08.706
But he was gone.

01:10:09.374 --> 01:10:10.375
So were his champions.

01:10:10.458 --> 01:10:12.168
I do not know what happened to them.

01:10:14.379 --> 01:10:15.922
I only know that I am alone.

01:10:20.134 --> 01:10:21.803
[Shao Kahn] Chain her up
in the town square.

01:10:21.886 --> 01:10:25.431
Let the princess's treason
serve as a warning to all.

01:10:25.515 --> 01:10:27.517
[suspenseful music playing]

01:10:39.112 --> 01:10:40.113
Jade.

01:10:41.656 --> 01:10:43.282
I know she's like a sister to you.

01:10:43.992 --> 01:10:46.119
That was no small thing you just did.

01:10:47.245 --> 01:10:48.830
I still remember the little girl

01:10:48.913 --> 01:10:50.623
we pulled from the fighting pits.

01:10:51.290 --> 01:10:53.042
More animal than child.

01:10:54.419 --> 01:10:57.505
But I see now I made the right choice.

01:11:09.058 --> 01:11:11.102
[Liu Kang] We'll cover
more ground if we split up.

01:11:12.186 --> 01:11:15.064
Find the amulet. And don't get caught.

01:11:16.357 --> 01:11:17.650
[Sonya] Come on, you're with me.

01:11:39.797 --> 01:11:40.882
[door opens]

01:11:45.595 --> 01:11:47.513
[Shao Kahn] And what do we have here?

01:11:47.597 --> 01:11:50.725
Raiden sends one of his
sad little followers.

01:11:50.808 --> 01:11:53.436
[scoffs] A gift from a dying god.

01:11:54.771 --> 01:11:56.105
-[grunting]
-[punching]

01:11:56.189 --> 01:11:57.690
-[Shao Kahn yells]
-[weapon clangs]

01:12:15.374 --> 01:12:17.752
[dragons roar, chitter]

01:12:26.761 --> 01:12:28.387
I am Liu Kang.

01:12:29.222 --> 01:12:31.307
The last son of the dragon.

01:12:32.183 --> 01:12:35.895
-And I shall watch you burn.
-[dragons roaring]

01:12:39.315 --> 01:12:41.317
[grunting]

01:12:43.361 --> 01:12:44.362
[groans]

01:12:46.572 --> 01:12:47.573
[sighs]

01:12:52.411 --> 01:12:53.412
[gasps]

01:12:55.748 --> 01:12:56.874
[clangs]

01:12:56.958 --> 01:12:57.959
[screams]

01:13:09.387 --> 01:13:10.388
[thuds]

01:13:14.433 --> 01:13:15.768
-[grunts]
-[clangs]

01:13:25.069 --> 01:13:26.154
[groans]

01:13:28.197 --> 01:13:29.407
[faintly] The amulet.

01:13:30.491 --> 01:13:31.492
[Shao Kahn yells]

